## Types of cybersecurity hiring tests

| Job position | Typical assessment |
| --- | --- |
| SOC Analyst | SIEM alerts, log analysis, incident response |
| Cybersecurity Analyst | Threat identification, security fundamentals |
| Penetration Tester | Vulnerability analysis, authorized lab exercises |
| Security Engineer | Network security, firewalls, system security |
| Information Security Analyst | Risk management, policies, compliance |
| Cloud Security Engineer | AWS, Azure, cloud security |
| GRC Analyst | NIST, ISO 27001, risk assessments |

